[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m <｜User｜>If $(x + 1) + (x + 2) + ... + (x + 20) = 174 + 176 + 178 + ... + 192$, then what is the value of $x$?
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m $\mathrm{(A) \ } 80 \qquad \mathrm{(B) \ } 81 \qquad \mathrm {(C) \ } 82 \qquad \mathrm{(D) \ } 83 \qquad \mathrm{(E) \ } 84$
