[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \frac{t + s}{t - s} = 3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m t + s = 3(t - s) \implies t + s = 3t - 3s \implifies to -2t + 4s = 0 \implies t = 2s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m where \( t = \sqrt{x} \) and \( s = \sqrt[3]{x} \). This implies \( \sqrt{x} = 2 \sqrt[3]{x} \). Expressing in exponents, let \( x = k^6 \), we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \sqrt{x} = k^3 \text{ and } \sqrt[3]{x} = k^2 \implies k^3 = 2 k^2 \implies k = 2 \impl x = 2^6 = 64
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m Thus, the solution is \( x = 64 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \boxed{64}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1799)[0m [train sample] end
